# The demonstration database (data/lga_amp.duckdb) is a right-sized build kept
# under GitHub's 100 MB file limit and committed as a normal blob, so the app is
# self-contained and loads instantly on the host (no LFS, no external download).
#
# If you ever ship a larger, full-resolution DB instead, track it with Git LFS:
#   git lfs install && git lfs track "*.duckdb"
# and remove the `!data/lga_amp.duckdb` exception from .gitignore.
